# Format before commit

CI runs `npx nx format:check --base=origin/main`. ESLint does not check `tools/*.mjs`, so lint and tests can pass while this step fails.

Before every `git commit`:

```bash
npx nx format:write
npx nx format:check --base=origin/main
```

Prettier print width is 80. Do not commit a file that `format:check` reports.
